# Placeholder for Screen 8 Simulation Transition Audio

This is a placeholder file for the audio that will play during the bot transition when the simulation popup opens in Screen 8.

## Instructions for User:
1. Replace this file with your actual audio file
2. The audio should contain the text: "Here is an hands on interesting simualtion for you to try on.. Go ahead and turn the tap ON !!"
3. Keep the filename as: screen8-simulation-transition.mp3
4. Ensure the audio file is in MP3 format

## Current Configuration:
- Text: "Here is an hands on interesting simualtion for you to try on.. Go ahead and turn the tap ON !!"
- Bot Message: "Time for some hands-on learning! 🧪"
- Duration: 4000ms (4 seconds)
- File Path: audio/screen8-simulation-transition.mp3
- Trigger: When simulation popup opens in Screen 8

The system will automatically use TTS (Text-to-Speech) as a fallback if the audio file is not available or fails to load.
